  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.15\n\t\t\t    - Added new model TermsQueryModel, StandardTermsAddModel and DateDrivenTermsAddModel\n\t\t\t\t- Added new DTOs StandardTermsRetDto and DateDrivenTermsRetDto\n\t\t\t\t- Added new Terms result view QbTermsView\n\t\t\t\t- Added new Terms test to QbModels.TEST\n\t\t\t\t- Added Termsfield to CustomerQueryModel, InvoiceQueryModel and SalesOrderQueryModel\n\t\t\t\t- Changed Terms field in BillRetDto from private to public\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t    v1.2.14\n\t\t        - Updated InvoiceLineAddDto parameter DataExt to list of DataExtRet\n\t\t\t\t- Added InvoiceAddModel parameter IncludeRetElement to list of string\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t    v1.2.13\n\t\t\t    - Changed query request parameter IncludeRetElement to list of string instead of string\n\t\t\t\t\n            v1.2.12\n                - Fixed BaseListQueryRq MaxReturned logic\n\t\t\t\t\n            v1.2.11\n                - Added DataExtRet to SalesOrder response view\n\n            v1.2.10\n                - Added ItemInventoryAssembly requests. \n                - Added TaxRegistrationNumber to Customer return model\n                - Changed ShipToAddress to be a list and added required Name property\n                - Added new BaseAddressDto\n                - Refactored AddressDto and ShipToAddressDto to use BaseAddressDto",
